  "service_operation_scope": "Parameters plus explicit routing command, stripped before original wire dispatch. data has the original websocket.USER_FIELDS syntactic field set and primary JSON types; repository.permission_data/build_user supply nested permissions/schedules/profile/CAS/validity invariants. Unsupported protected fields are refused by original route policy; schema acceptance is not business acceptance. Original v1/v2 metadata schema preserved in legacy/.",
  "signed_event_scope": "Original frame.event is unmodified route-specific event payload, not automatically EventRecord. Persistent EventRecord is nested in events/resume pages. HMAC uses actual frame bytes and current challenge; all sample signatures are public synthetic placeholders and are NOT authentic evidence."
